Package: AlphaFoldMVN
Title: What the Package Does (One Line, Title Case)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Xiaoke", "Qin", , "Xiaoke.Qin@umanitoba.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Provides functions for defining, simulating, and estimating the parameters of 
    the alpha-folded multivariate normal (MVN) distribution. 
    The package includes density, random generation, and cumulative 
    distribution functions, along with parameter estimation routines based 
    on maximum likelihood and method-of-moments approaches. 
    Designed for research on non-Gaussian modeling and folded or skewed 
    multivariate data.
